Get one project by id or slug

Usage:
  mdr project get <id> [flags]

Arguments:
  <id>   project id or slug

Global flags (-o, --fields, --full, --dry-run, ...): see mdr --help

Output fields (default; all: mdr schema project get):
  id, slug

Examples:
  mdr project get sodium

API: GET /project/{id|slug}
